msgid ""
"the JSON-LD @type returned by the data type: upgraded from \"xsd:string\" to "
"precise XSD types (xsd:date, xsd:gYear, xsd:gYearMonth, xsd:dateTime) for "
"pure dates, and to the Library of Congress EDTF URI for advanced forms;"
